Training data

The community scoring heads distributed with this project were trained on
speechocean762, licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (CC BY 4.0).

    speechocean762: An Open-Source Non-Native English Speech Corpus for
    Pronunciation Assessment. Interspeech 2021.
    https://www.openslr.org/101/
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The corpus itself is not redistributed here. The heads are a derivative of it
and are checked in under releases/, licensed CC BY 4.0 as well — see
LICENSE-MODELS, which also gives the wording to use when crediting them. The
source in this repository is Apache-2.0 and is covered by LICENSE instead.

