Acoustic model

The optional acoustic checkpoint is an ONNX export of
torchaudio.pipelines.WAV2VEC2_ASR_BASE_960H, i.e. Facebook's
wav2vec2-base-960h, pretrained and fine-tuned on LibriSpeech 960h. Those weights
are third-party and are covered by their original upstream license, not by this
repository's Apache-2.0.

    https://huggingface.co/facebook/wav2vec2-base-960h
